<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-021" chapter-id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang" source-id="s-nanshi-021-wangyang-ws1752646">
  <p id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA">瑒</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA">子瑛</persName>，沈靜有器局，美風儀。梁元帝時，位太子中庶子。陳武帝入輔，以爲司徒左長史。文帝即位，累遷太子中庶子、散騎常侍、侍中。父<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:m0063" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA">沖</persName>嘗爲<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:m0066" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA">瑒</persName>辭領中庶子，文帝顧<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:m0076" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA">沖</persName>曰：「所以久留<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:m0084" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA">瑒</persName>于承華，正欲使太子微有<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:m0096" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA">瑒</persName>風法耳。」</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">宣帝即位，曆中書令，吏部尚書。<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p002:m0015" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA">瑒</persName>性寬和，務清靜，無所抑揚。遷尚書左僕射，加侍中，參選事。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p003:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA">瑒</persName>居家篤睦，毎歲時饋遺，遍及近親。敦誘諸弟，稟其規訓。卒，贈特進，諡曰光子。</p>
</text>
